.DS_Store
Archive.zip
*.zip
*.dev-setup-run.log
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# This tool can clone ANY repo DEFINED in config/projects.json (or in the
# list auto-fetched from GitHub) — the name isn't fixed. Previously these
# directories were ignored one by one, by name (my-backend-repo/ etc.); when
# a new project is added, or the tool is used to test against some other
# repo name that was never added, it's easy to forget, and that repo's
# ENTIRE source code/secrets could accidentally end up in this tool's own
# (private) repo history. Instead, we ignore EVERY top-level directory by
# default and only carve out exceptions for the tool's own source code
# (src/, bin/, config/, scripts/) and the dependency lock files outside
# node_modules — so no newly cloned/tested project ever ends up in this
# repo, and there's no need to remember to update .gitignore.
/*/
!/src/
!/bin/
!/config/
!/scripts/
